WEBVTT

00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:13.958
"Dear Miss Excel, I always have
fun watching your TV program,

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:19.083
but... but you've only shown
filthy men for a while now

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:21.208
and I'm beginning to
not want to watch anymore.

00:00:21.208 --> 00:00:24.458
Please do something about it.
Thank you.

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:26.042
Hail, roger!"

00:00:26.042 --> 00:00:28.375
Mysterious pretty young girl with
an anonymous request!

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:30.000
Is it okay?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.833
Go away!

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:32.458
We have no need for filthy men!

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:34.208
This week, of course,
we'll be covered with pretty girls!

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:36.042
Cute animals will be
positioned here and there.

00:00:36.042 --> 00:00:38.292
Highlights and shadows will be
increased by twenty-seven percent

00:00:38.292 --> 00:00:39.583
compared to the norm at this firm!

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:44.542
If that is the case, will Lord Ilpalazzo
not be appearing either?

00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:48.208
On this occasion, sure!

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:52.000
Senior Excel...

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:06.542
<i>Sore wa ai ja nai</i>

00:01:06.542 --> 00:01:10.500
<i>Ai wa sore ja nai</i>

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:18.375
<i>Aishite iru kedo aisarete wa inai</i>

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:22.250
<i>Kesshite ai ja nai</i>

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:26.333
<i>Ketsu wa ai ja nai</i>

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:34.042
<i>Aisaretai keredo motometari wa shinai</i>

00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:38.708
<i>Kono mi sasagete inochi nagedashi</i>

00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:42.792
<i>Wakime mo furazu tada hitasura ni</i>

00:01:42.792 --> 00:01:46.708
<i>Damashite sukashite yokohairi</i>

00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:49.917
<i>Tanin o fumitaoshi keri o kamashite</i>

00:01:49.917 --> 00:01:52.125
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:52.125 --> 00:01:54.042
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:54.042 --> 00:01:55.917
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:55.917 --> 00:01:57.833
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>

00:01:57.833 --> 00:02:02.667
<i>Banana no kawa de korondemo</i>

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:05.792
<i>Sore wa subete ano kata no tame</i>

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:10.292
<i>Shiite iu nara sore wa kitto</i>

00:02:10.292 --> 00:02:18.125
<i>Ai to iu na no chuuseishin</i>

00:02:25.208 --> 00:02:28.667
So, they all took a paid vacation?

00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:29.625
Yes.

00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:33.167
Since there were no legal
problems with it, I accepted them.

00:02:33.167 --> 00:02:34.875
Is there a problem with that?

00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:37.292
No, not really.

00:02:37.292 --> 00:02:39.208
The vacation is three days long.

00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:42.042
I have asked Mr. Shioji to
recover the destroyed equipment

00:02:42.042 --> 00:02:45.042
and repair it by then.

00:02:45.042 --> 00:02:47.500
I see. Thank you, Momoji.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.667
It is my job, after all.

00:02:50.667 --> 00:02:52.625
Is this part of your job too?

00:02:52.625 --> 00:02:54.875
What might you be talking about?

00:03:01.125 --> 00:03:02.667
Hello, Excel here.

00:03:02.667 --> 00:03:05.333
These days, I am myself realizing
that global warming is really progressing

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:07.417
due to the reckless destruction
of the environment by mankind,

00:03:07.417 --> 00:03:08.792
who think nothing of the consequences.

00:03:08.792 --> 00:03:10.208
In other words, it's hot, but...

00:03:10.208 --> 00:03:11.833
Vacation? Yes, well, that's right.

00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:13.833
The story's long and short,
but our plans to conquer the city

00:03:13.833 --> 00:03:16.500
have met failure after failure
and it was like "you goofball" and we,

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.917
the ideological organization
ACROSS, have run out of funds,

00:03:17.917 --> 00:03:19.792
so we decided we may as
well make a vacation out of it.

00:03:19.792 --> 00:03:21.833
There's nothing important to
do and if I move, I'll burn calories,

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:24.625
so I'm in the middle of
quietly preserving my energy.

00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:26.708
In short, it's sort of an unpaid vacation,

00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:29.500
or in this case, you could
even call it a temporary restructuring.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.708
It's been a while
since our food stores ran out.

00:03:31.708 --> 00:03:33.708
In other words, today...

00:03:33.708 --> 00:03:35.542
I'm on the verge of declaring
a state of emergency

00:03:35.542 --> 00:03:37.292
and submitting a petition
to my own committee

00:03:37.292 --> 00:03:38.875
for permission to use
the emergency food supply

00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:40.792
and adopting the policy
by an overwhelming majority.

00:03:40.792 --> 00:03:43.000
Oh, I'm so tired.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.625
Hatchan, what should we
do for food today?

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:47.667
Thank you for the food.

00:03:47.667 --> 00:03:49.792
Thank you for the food.

00:03:50.958 --> 00:03:52.917
Hatchan, who's that?

00:03:52.917 --> 00:03:57.417
Oh, this is Miss Cosette Sara.
She lives in the neighborhood.

00:03:57.417 --> 00:03:59.208
Nice to meet you.

00:03:59.208 --> 00:04:01.542
What an unfortunate-sounding name.

00:04:01.542 --> 00:04:03.792
I had been seeing
her often in the park lately

00:04:03.792 --> 00:04:06.458
and when I told her of our situation,

00:04:06.458 --> 00:04:10.542
she went to the trouble of
bringing us food from her home.

00:04:10.542 --> 00:04:11.708
Right?

00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:15.875
Oh, me, me, me, what,
what, what, what about my share?!

00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:19.042
I've been calling you for about an hour,

00:04:19.042 --> 00:04:21.958
but you seemed to be deep
in thought about something, so...

00:04:21.958 --> 00:04:23.625
B-But...

00:04:30.625 --> 00:04:32.458
Menchi!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.208
It's leftovers from my school lunch.

00:04:53.042 --> 00:04:56.042
This must be fate!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:19.750
But Miss Cosette, I thought
it was now summer vacation...

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.625
Yes, so it's from three weeks ago.

00:05:24.417 --> 00:05:24.958
--But I already digested it...

00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:26.625
--Yes?
--But I already digested it...

00:05:27.667 --> 00:05:29.333
Who is...

00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:33.125
Hello, I'm a saleswoman
for the Pretty Girl Newspaper.

00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:34.792
Have you ever heard
of the Pretty Girl Newspaper?

00:05:34.792 --> 00:05:36.167
In other words, it's a newspaper
for beauties by beauties.

00:05:36.167 --> 00:05:38.083
We restrict our readership quite a
bit, but as beautiful as you are,

00:05:38.083 --> 00:05:39.833
this would truly be a
perfect daily newspaper for you!

00:05:39.833 --> 00:05:41.625
From page one, we have beauties
of the world, beauty goods,

00:05:41.625 --> 00:05:43.208
lessons in facials, fashion
beauties, beauty clinic hell,

00:05:43.208 --> 00:05:44.458
four frame comics of
tranquil beauties, and so on.

00:05:44.458 --> 00:05:45.875
A luxurious serial publication
of eighteen great beauties.

00:05:45.875 --> 00:05:46.958
Publicly, we say that
we've sold six million copies.

00:05:46.958 --> 00:05:47.958
We have seven thousand in real sales.

00:05:47.958 --> 00:05:49.708
The Pretty Girl Newspaper's
motto is to be honest.

00:05:49.708 --> 00:05:50.958
That honesty appealed
to your neighbors

00:05:50.958 --> 00:05:52.625
and they subscribed for a month's worth.

00:05:52.625 --> 00:05:54.875
Won't you subscribe as well?
Swallow it already, you idiot.

00:05:54.875 --> 00:05:56.958
Oh, I mean, humor
me and try it for a month.

00:05:56.958 --> 00:05:59.333
If you get it now, I'll give you
three free tickets to the city pool.

00:05:59.333 --> 00:06:01.333
It's a great deal!
It's a great deal! Here you go!

00:06:01.333 --> 00:06:03.083
It's a great deal!
Here, here, here, here!

00:06:03.083 --> 00:06:05.042
You have accepted them.
You have accepted them!

00:06:05.042 --> 00:06:07.333
Now please sign your
name on a one-month contract

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:09.167
and place your seal on it!

00:06:09.958 --> 00:06:10.458
"Tomato"

00:06:10.458 --> 00:06:12.500
"Tomato"
Please pardon me.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.667
And she threw up!

00:06:18.667 --> 00:06:20.792
It's me.

00:06:20.792 --> 00:06:22.333
I understand.

00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:25.875
--I'll leave that up to you.
--My stomach and intestines are doing the limbo dance!

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.000
Oh, this way, this way, John. John!

00:06:39.708 --> 00:06:42.375
Oh, don't pull so much!

00:06:45.958 --> 00:06:50.125
The great race about to begin!

00:06:50.208 --> 00:06:50.917
"Hugely Popular Everywhere!"

00:06:50.917 --> 00:06:53.542
"What's with this newspaper?"
"Hugely Popular Everywhere!"

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.917
You idiot, it's a respectable
newspaper for beauties!

00:06:57.917 --> 00:06:59.167
"You subscribed?"

00:06:59.167 --> 00:07:00.958
I-I don't want to talk about it.

00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:02.708
"I think there's more to it."

00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:05.083
That's not true! No way that's true!

00:07:05.083 --> 00:07:06.458
"And you're agitated now."

00:07:06.458 --> 00:07:08.958
Beauties! Beauties, beauties,
Pretty Girl Newspaper!

00:07:08.958 --> 00:07:12.167
Oh hey, I knew you'd have
tickets to the pool too, Watanabe!

00:07:12.167 --> 00:07:14.375
That means you subscribed
to the Pretty Girl Newspaper.

00:07:14.375 --> 00:07:15.958
Didn't you, you persistent pervert?

00:07:15.958 --> 00:07:17.500
Come to think of it,
if we both use our tickets,

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.208
we could take Misaki and Sumiyoshi
and all go to the pool together.

00:07:20.208 --> 00:07:21.750
You have no choice!

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.250
Why is your mind so quick
only when it comes to these things?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:27.750
So? Are we going or not?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.458
I'll get ready. Happy?

00:07:29.458 --> 00:07:32.875
Beauty Theater!

00:07:32.875 --> 00:07:33.958
"Beauty Theater"
"The Riceman Cometh"

00:07:33.958 --> 00:07:36.375
This is part one.

00:07:36.375 --> 00:07:40.583
Hello, I'm from the Mikawa-Ya!
I came to deliver rice, Ma'am!

00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:43.750
I'm sorry, I'm in the middle
of a shower right now.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.417
Could you leave it at the door?

00:07:45.417 --> 00:07:47.083
All right!

00:08:00.917 --> 00:08:02.000
Here it comes!

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.250
Okay!

00:08:32.042 --> 00:08:34.083
It's almost unnatural how
such a beautiful ignorant mass

00:08:34.083 --> 00:08:35.583
is flocking to the water.

00:08:35.583 --> 00:08:37.958
But you know,
we'd have been in big trouble

00:08:37.958 --> 00:08:40.917
if little Cosette hadn't
treated us to hamburgers.

00:08:40.917 --> 00:08:42.958
Er, Senior?

00:08:42.958 --> 00:08:43.625
What is it?

00:08:43.625 --> 00:08:46.167
What an unconventional swimsuit.

00:08:46.167 --> 00:08:47.708
Oh, this?

00:08:47.708 --> 00:08:50.500
A nice person I knew at one of
my old part-time jobs gave it to me.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.625
It's so nice and functional,
don't you think?

00:08:52.625 --> 00:08:54.875
What a wonderful part-time job.

00:08:54.875 --> 00:08:57.417
If it's for swimming, this is plenty good.

00:08:57.417 --> 00:09:00.833
Shouldn't we be conquering the city?

00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:02.333
Well, we are on vacation right now

00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:04.000
and you have to step
into their shoes to directly learn

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.667
what it feels like to be one of the masses.

00:09:08.083 --> 00:09:10.667
What are you whispering about?

00:09:16.875 --> 00:09:19.000
This is sort of criminal in its own way...

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.792
What is she talking about?

00:09:20.792 --> 00:09:24.417
Perhaps she is happy to have
been able to come to the pool...

00:09:24.417 --> 00:09:27.542
Your friend is kind of weird.

00:09:27.542 --> 00:09:30.875
I do not know why,
but people say that a lot.

00:09:30.875 --> 00:09:32.750
Summer is the time of
diffused reflections off the water.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.833
A good season that sometimes
gives rise to memorable moments!

00:09:34.833 --> 00:09:37.042
I'm really glad the Earth is tilted.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:40.125
"Ah, the pool.
I haven't been to one in years."

00:09:40.792 --> 00:09:42.958
Shut up, you guys!

00:09:44.792 --> 00:09:48.542
Misaki, do you know the
proper form of the butterfly?

00:09:48.542 --> 00:09:52.250
I hold the record in a district
swim meet. What about it?

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:53.667
"His jab failed."

00:09:53.667 --> 00:09:56.125
That was a jab?

00:09:56.125 --> 00:10:01.375
Misaki, it seems that the dawn
at a nearby hotel is waiting for us.

00:10:02.125 --> 00:10:03.042
"Crunch!"

00:10:03.833 --> 00:10:05.542
"Now that was a haymaker."

00:10:05.542 --> 00:10:07.583
He just has nothing to fight with.

00:10:09.667 --> 00:10:11.958
Oh, come to think of it, that's right.

00:10:11.958 --> 00:10:15.083
Hatchan said she couldn't swim normally.

00:10:15.083 --> 00:10:19.250
But why can't she float in
the water except in that position?

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:20.750
Here, you okay?

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.083
Yes...

00:10:25.417 --> 00:10:27.833
H-Having fun?

00:10:27.833 --> 00:10:29.250
Getting there.

00:10:31.583 --> 00:10:32.583
How should I say this?

00:10:32.583 --> 00:10:34.917
I don't know what's going
through that child's head, you know?

00:10:34.917 --> 00:10:37.292
I think I sort of understand
why she gets along with Hatchan,

00:10:37.292 --> 00:10:39.042
but then again, maybe not...

00:10:39.042 --> 00:10:41.292
Mommy, I want to go over to that pool.

00:10:41.292 --> 00:10:43.125
All right, sweetie.

00:10:44.583 --> 00:10:46.833
Is something wrong?

00:10:46.833 --> 00:10:49.125
I'm hungry.

00:10:49.125 --> 00:10:52.417
I'd love to completely
back you up on that issue,

00:10:52.417 --> 00:10:55.208
but we're kind of short
on what's most important...

00:10:55.208 --> 00:10:56.708
I have some.

00:10:56.708 --> 00:10:58.208
I'm counting on you!

00:10:58.625 --> 00:11:01.542
Beauty Theater!

00:11:01.542 --> 00:11:02.833
"Beauty Theater"
"Intense Speed"

00:11:02.833 --> 00:11:04.792
This is part two.

00:11:06.083 --> 00:11:07.792
Hello?

00:11:07.792 --> 00:11:10.333
Oh, what can I do for you today?

00:11:10.333 --> 00:11:12.833
Okay. Yeah, sure.

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:14.208
"The End"

00:11:14.208 --> 00:11:15.917
So intense!

00:11:17.667 --> 00:11:20.292
Oden stew, fried noodles,
a hot dog with lots of mustard,

00:11:20.292 --> 00:11:22.125
and two strawberry frappes,
a big bowl of ramen,

00:11:22.125 --> 00:11:23.625
a sandwich, curry, and some <i>foie gras</i>!

00:11:23.625 --> 00:11:25.125
Ain't got all that.

00:11:25.125 --> 00:11:26.625
I knew it wasn't going to happen.

00:11:26.625 --> 00:11:27.958
Then I guess you
won't have banana dumplings,

00:11:27.958 --> 00:11:29.375
--I know.
--mayonnaise tofu muniere, panna cotta,

00:11:29.375 --> 00:11:29.875
--Send me the target information.
--mayonnaise tofu muniere, panna cotta,

00:11:29.875 --> 00:11:31.167
--Send me the target information.
--and salt broiled fish, right? Oh, fine!

00:11:31.167 --> 00:11:33.500
--I'll implement as soon as I find the target.
--and salt broiled fish, right? Oh, fine!

00:11:36.542 --> 00:11:38.542
Wow, she's so cute!

00:11:38.542 --> 00:11:39.792
What's your name?

00:11:39.792 --> 00:11:42.333
I'm Cosette.

00:11:45.792 --> 00:11:48.500
Why is it that there
are only women here?

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.500
But I'm here! I'm here!

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:51.542
I can't see you.

00:11:51.542 --> 00:11:54.458
Damn it, put me on the screen!

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.167
I guess even in the second half...

00:12:00.167 --> 00:12:03.167
They probably won't
let us show up on camera.

00:12:08.667 --> 00:12:11.667
Hey, it's you, Miss Ayasugi.

00:12:12.667 --> 00:12:16.417
Pardon me, but who are you?

00:12:16.417 --> 00:12:17.625
What?

00:12:18.625 --> 00:12:21.875
Oh, you're the next-door neighbor.

00:12:21.875 --> 00:12:25.958
Please excuse me,
I don't have my contacts in.

00:12:25.958 --> 00:12:27.958
Oh, I see.

00:12:27.958 --> 00:12:29.042
Are you by yourself?

00:12:29.042 --> 00:12:32.458
No, I'm here with my
senior coworker and a girl

00:12:32.458 --> 00:12:34.375
who lives in my neighborhood.

00:12:34.375 --> 00:12:36.375
Oh, okay.

00:12:36.375 --> 00:12:38.125
All right.

00:12:38.125 --> 00:12:40.708
I-I'm going to go get some juice too.

00:12:40.708 --> 00:12:45.333
Oh, in that case, I've had enough,

00:12:45.333 --> 00:12:48.375
so you can have mine if you'd like.

00:12:50.042 --> 00:12:53.167
The least I can do is be
casual about an indirect kiss!

00:12:53.167 --> 00:12:55.875
T-Then I'll have some.

00:12:55.875 --> 00:12:58.750
Please excuse me,
I need to go to the bathroom.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.833
Oh, sure.

00:13:00.833 --> 00:13:02.917
Why hasn't the amount
of juice decreased?

00:13:02.917 --> 00:13:04.625
Or rather, it's overfull.

00:13:04.625 --> 00:13:07.083
But so what? This is no
time to be having a dilemma.

00:13:07.083 --> 00:13:10.542
Here I go. I'm going to do it.
Indirect smooch! A smooch!

00:13:19.792 --> 00:13:21.417
Guess I'm a little rusty.

00:13:21.417 --> 00:13:24.208
Why don't you stop swimming
and come play with me?

00:13:24.208 --> 00:13:25.250
Doing what?

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:26.750
Play pro-wrestling.

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:27.625
"Bash!"

00:13:28.917 --> 00:13:31.458
That wasn't meant to be taken literally.

00:13:33.125 --> 00:13:37.583
Lord Ilpalazzo,
Excel has eaten too much.

00:13:37.583 --> 00:13:39.583
Is this too predictable?

00:13:39.583 --> 00:13:42.792
Do I look like a beauty in agony?

00:13:42.792 --> 00:13:45.708
Beauty Theater!

00:13:45.708 --> 00:13:46.917
"Beauty Theater"
"Same Room"

00:13:46.917 --> 00:13:48.792
This is part thr--

00:13:51.667 --> 00:13:55.125
W-What are you doing here, Kosuke?!

00:13:55.125 --> 00:13:57.958
M-Megumi told me that this was my room!

00:13:57.958 --> 00:13:59.833
Damn, Megu.

00:14:01.042 --> 00:14:02.958
W-What's going on?

00:14:02.958 --> 00:14:06.625
N-Nothing. This is embarrassing!

00:14:06.625 --> 00:14:08.292
Yukari, I...

00:14:09.625 --> 00:14:11.292
Kosuke...

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:12.208
"The End"

00:14:12.208 --> 00:14:14.458
Oh, but... No...

00:14:18.042 --> 00:14:21.458
Where could have Senior gone?

00:14:21.458 --> 00:14:22.833
Oh?

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:29.583
<i>Black hair and a mole</i>
<i>by her mouth on the left.</i>

00:14:29.583 --> 00:14:31.542
<i>No mistake about it.</i>

00:14:36.208 --> 00:14:38.333
My, Miss Cosette...

00:14:45.875 --> 00:14:47.208
Mother!

00:14:47.208 --> 00:14:48.667
Yes, sweetie.

00:14:52.667 --> 00:14:54.958
Hey, let's play with the ball next.

00:14:54.958 --> 00:14:57.000
Now, now, there's no rush.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.083
Hurry, hurry!

00:14:58.083 --> 00:14:59.833
Oh, really.

00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:19.000
Mommy...

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.792
Mommy...

00:15:21.542 --> 00:15:24.875
Mommy...

00:15:24.875 --> 00:15:26.167
Mommy...

00:15:26.167 --> 00:15:27.500
Mommy...

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.250
Mommy...

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:31.458
Mommy...

00:15:31.458 --> 00:15:35.458
Work harder! Really!
What a dim-witted child!

00:16:26.042 --> 00:16:28.083
There, there, there.

00:16:41.333 --> 00:16:45.333
Miss Cosette, have you seen Senior?

00:16:50.417 --> 00:16:52.792
Is there something about those people?

00:16:52.792 --> 00:16:56.750
Oh, well... It's nothing, Hyatt.

00:16:59.958 --> 00:17:03.208
Could it be that you are
waiting for your mother as well?

00:17:03.208 --> 00:17:06.625
How could I be?! She's dead!

00:17:06.625 --> 00:17:09.458
Well... that's...

00:17:09.458 --> 00:17:11.833
Shut up! Don't look at me!

00:17:15.583 --> 00:17:17.000
Burp.

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.500
I'm sexy...

00:17:28.167 --> 00:17:29.750
I want to...

00:17:32.792 --> 00:17:34.792
I want to see her!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.583
I want to see her!

00:17:39.583 --> 00:17:41.250
Miss Cose--

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:50.000
Hyatt, I...
I want to see my mother!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.708
--I want to see her!

00:17:51.708 --> 00:17:53.042
--Today is just so hot.
--I want to see her!

00:17:53.042 --> 00:17:55.208
It's not normal.
Not normal at all.

00:17:59.208 --> 00:18:01.917
What? Where am I?

00:18:01.917 --> 00:18:05.667
Hyatt, where are you?
Where are you?

00:18:11.417 --> 00:18:13.667
Am I dreaming?

00:18:15.958 --> 00:18:19.083
Where am I?!

00:18:27.125 --> 00:18:29.125
Mother...

00:18:33.292 --> 00:18:36.250
Mother... Mother!

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:39.167
Mother, it's me, Cosette!

00:18:39.167 --> 00:18:40.667
Mother!

00:18:40.667 --> 00:18:42.250
Stop!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.792
Who are you?! Let me go!
I said, let me go!

00:18:45.792 --> 00:18:47.167
You must not!

00:18:47.167 --> 00:18:52.375
Why not?! Mother's right there!
She's my mother!

00:18:52.375 --> 00:18:54.125
Why are you stopping me?!

00:18:54.125 --> 00:18:56.625
That is the land of the dead.

00:18:56.625 --> 00:18:58.417
Take a good look at your mother.

00:18:58.417 --> 00:19:00.875
Does she look like
she's welcoming you?

00:19:00.875 --> 00:19:04.625
All she's doing is waving to you sadly.

00:19:04.625 --> 00:19:05.625
But...

00:19:05.625 --> 00:19:08.083
Your mother wanted to see you too.

00:19:08.083 --> 00:19:10.917
Just like you did,
she wanted to see you too.

00:19:10.917 --> 00:19:14.250
But if she came any closer,
she would rob you of your soul.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.208
That is why she isn't coming closer.

00:19:16.208 --> 00:19:19.583
Please understand
how hard it is for your mother.

00:19:19.583 --> 00:19:20.917
Mother...

00:19:28.125 --> 00:19:30.958
Mother, I'm doing well!

00:19:30.958 --> 00:19:36.125
I can make it through
this wretched world! So...

00:19:36.125 --> 00:19:37.458
So...

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.583
Mother...

00:19:41.583 --> 00:19:44.958
Mother, no! Don't go!

00:19:44.958 --> 00:19:47.958
Mother!

00:19:56.375 --> 00:20:02.333
I'm sorry. I'll be good.
I'll be good, so...

00:20:02.333 --> 00:20:08.292
Miss Cosette, your mother loves you.
She loves you very much.

00:20:08.292 --> 00:20:12.833
So different from me!
I was betrayed by my wife!

00:20:18.667 --> 00:20:22.792
What a sorrowful life you have, Cosette!

00:20:22.792 --> 00:20:25.833
Leave it to me. Leave it all up to me.

00:20:32.083 --> 00:20:34.917
Mysteriously abnormal
temperatures at the public pool?

00:20:34.917 --> 00:20:37.708
Who would have thought that such
a thing could happen?

00:20:37.708 --> 00:20:41.333
Iwata, Watanabe, and Sumiyoshi
have been confirmed

00:20:41.333 --> 00:20:43.375
to be among
the victims of sunstroke.

00:20:43.375 --> 00:20:45.667
Watanabe's symptoms are
especially serious

00:20:45.667 --> 00:20:48.875
and his doctor has
ordered him to get complete rest.

00:20:48.875 --> 00:20:51.875
Are you saying that this was
a conspiracy by a society of evil?

00:20:52.875 --> 00:20:55.042
What kind of incident was it?!

00:20:55.042 --> 00:20:56.708
We do not know the cause.

00:20:56.708 --> 00:20:59.333
According to the testimony
of a relatively unscathed patient,

00:20:59.333 --> 00:21:01.792
something about
a mother waving her hand...

00:21:01.792 --> 00:21:03.417
Incomprehensible.

00:21:03.417 --> 00:21:04.917
I agree.

00:21:04.917 --> 00:21:06.625
What about your opinion?!

00:21:06.625 --> 00:21:08.542
I do not know.

00:21:10.333 --> 00:21:13.333
I see, that's what I thought too.

00:21:16.875 --> 00:21:18.792
Hello, Excel here.

00:21:18.792 --> 00:21:20.750
I ate all I wanted and
got out what I needed to.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.250
For all that a lot of things happened,

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:24.250
lately the days are no
different than the days before.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:25.708
In other words, I'm hot and I'm hungry.

00:21:25.708 --> 00:21:27.542
Hatchan's all dried up
too and in such a condition

00:21:27.542 --> 00:21:29.083
that I can't talk about it.

00:21:29.083 --> 00:21:32.417
Oh, Lord Ilpalazzo, how long
is our vacation going to last?

00:21:32.417 --> 00:21:34.250
I don't want the
punch line to be "until we die".

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.333
Won't you please do something about it?

00:21:40.583 --> 00:21:42.833
Wait, Mother!

00:21:42.833 --> 00:21:44.500
Mother!

00:21:46.792 --> 00:21:48.292
And then...

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:51.083
I can't take it anymore!

00:21:51.583 --> 00:21:56.333
"Episode 8: Increase Ratings Week"

00:21:56.333 --> 00:21:58.292
